#% title
# golden_angle

#% text
# `golden_angle` is `pi (3 - sqrt(5))`, the angle in radians (about 137.5 degrees) that divides a full turn in the golden ratio.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
n(golden_angle)
#% output
#= 2.399963229728653

#% cell
n(golden_angle*180/pi)
#% output
#= 137.50776405003785

